{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261030/photo/bkn-20261030142509034-1030_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261030155901\"/><p>深圳將舉行APEC會議。</p><p>中國外交部周五（10月30日）宣布，為持續便利亞太區域商務人員往來，決定自下周日（11月1日）起把亞太經合組織（APEC）商務旅行卡持有人在華最長停留期由60天延長至90天。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:50.976386+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T06:25:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T10:22:16.984296+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:19:36.383715+00:00","content_hash":"5a4b6f04057285a7942ff1c5909155593761409b59810e321406f91281d2325f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-30T08:23:50.976386+00:00","latest_fallback":"minimal","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}